{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56290","headline":"石窟寺 · 牛承直","name":"石窟寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老去寻山意渐便，兴来登览独怡然。\n僧归禅榻香盈帐，人唤渔舟晚济川。\n清洛冷光浮巨栋，灵崧积翠拱中天。\n公余底事频来此，民远官刑不用鞭。\n（见上海图书馆胶卷复制天一阁藏书靖三十四年康绍第纂《巩县志》卷七。\n）（按：诗下署：「唐牛承直，巩县知县。\n」後录宋初李淑诗。\n同书卷二《职官》载唘知县：「牛承直，贯无考。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛承直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}